# Missions architecture (pointer)

Full law: [`docs/docs/architecture/missions.md`](../../docs/docs/architecture/missions.md).

**Permanent decision:** missions (contracts) are **server-owned** state —
accept / progress / fail / rewards. Pay is **ARC** (+ items / reputation /
XP) — **never AsteronCredits**. Offer surfaces: NPC giver, mission board,
HaloBand log. Defs / boards = live catalog (Console); spatial markers / NPC
offer ids / dens = editor → Build Web. Objective verbs use
[NPCs](../../docs/docs/architecture/npc.md); kill / escort creatures use
[Mobs](../../docs/docs/architecture/mobs.md). Standing:
[Factions](../../docs/docs/architecture/factions.md). Level/XP:
[Progression](../../docs/docs/architecture/progression.md). Loot packs:
[Loot tables](../../docs/docs/architecture/loot-tables.md). Presentation only:
[HaloBand](../../docs/docs/architecture/haloband.md).

When changing mission defs, boards, pay/rewards, objective credit, HaloBand
Missions, Star Map mission markers, or contract offer/turn-in flows, read the
full doc first. Also listed in `AGENTS.md`.
